					"content": "嗚，嗚！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751031103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊瓦伊"
				},
				{
					"id": 751031103,
					"content": "我準備的魚肉可是很充足的喔！要是可以把這些浮流鳥全部吸引過來的話…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751031104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "帕尼婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 751031104,
					"content": "#嘿嘿，{NICKNAME}，我們就像這樣，把剩下的浮流鳥也<color=#00E1FFFF>撞到岸上</color>來吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
